<%- include('partials/head', { pageTitle: 'Privacy policy' }) %>
<%- include('partials/header') %>

<main id="main-content" class="container">
    <article class="page-narrow prose">
        <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
        <p class="meta">Last updated: October 2026</p>

        <p><strong>In short:</strong> you can use Resume Rater without an account. We do not keep your resume text. If you sign in, we save only the scores and keyword gaps of your evaluations, and you can delete them at any time.</p>

        <h2>What happens to your resume</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>The PDF you upload is held in server memory while it is analysed and is discarded when the request ends. It is never written to disk.</li>
            <li>The extracted text is returned to your browser so you can see and re-score it. It is not stored on our servers.</li>
            <li>We do not use your resume to train models and we do not sell or share it.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>What we store if you sign in</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Account:</strong> your name, email address and a salted, one-way hash of your password (never the password itself).</li>
            <li><strong>Evaluation history:</strong> file name, detected field, page and word counts, match score, rating and the list of missing keywords. No resume text and no extracted sections.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Signing in is optional. Anonymous use stores nothing about you, other than messages you choose to send through the contact form.</p>

        <h2>Cookies</h2>
        <p>When you sign in we set one strictly necessary, httpOnly session cookie. We do not use advertising or analytics cookies.</p>

        <h2>Service providers</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Neon</strong> hosts the Postgres database that holds accounts and evaluation history.</li>
            <li><strong>Google Fonts</strong> serves the typeface, which means your browser requests it from Google.</li>
            <li>Our hosting provider processes requests on our behalf.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Your choices and rights</h2>
        <p>Signed-in users can delete all saved evaluations and their profile from the main page (&ldquo;Delete my saved data&rdquo;). For access or other requests, use the <a href="/contact">contact form</a><% if (locals.contactEmail) { %> or email <a href="mailto:<%= contactEmail %>"><%= contactEmail %></a><% } %>.</p>

        <h2>Security</h2>
        <p>Traffic is encrypted with HTTPS. Uploads are validated and size-limited, requests are rate-limited, session cookies are signed and httpOnly, and a strict Content Security Policy is enforced.</p>

        <h2>Changes</h2>
        <p>If this policy changes we will update the date above.</p>
    </article>
</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
